  "What changes when I follow one breath from beginning to end?": "What changes when I follow one breath from beginning to end?",
  "What changes when I treat a coincidence as correspondence?": "What changes when I treat a coincidence as correspondence?",
  "What changes when I watch the thought instead of being the thought?": "What changes when I watch the thought instead of being the thought?",
