  "What conversation would I re-run if the mirror allowed edits?": "What conversation would I re-run if the mirror allowed edits?",
  "What could a morning light machine do for a dark winter desk?": "What could a morning light machine do for a dark winter desk?",
  "What could a small machine do with an afternoon of sunlight?": "What could a small machine do with an afternoon of sunlight?",
  "What counts as an observer — a mind, a machine, a single photon?": "What counts as an observer — a mind, a machine, a single photon?",
  "What did Bell's theorem prove about hidden local realities?": "What did Bell's theorem prove about hidden local realities?",
  "What did my armor cost, and is it still worth the weight?": "What did my armor cost, and is it still worth the weight?",
  "What did my attention buy today, and was it worth the price?": "What did my attention buy today, and was it worth the price?",
