  "What did the builders of the great alignments hear from the sky?": "What did the builders of the great alignments hear from the sky?",
  "What did the early universe gain when symmetry finally cracked?": "What did the early universe gain when symmetry finally cracked?",
  "What did the first explorers log when they found our blue world?": "What did the first explorers log when they found our blue world?",
  "What did the Orion lessons plant in the soil of our modern century?": "What did the Orion lessons plant in the soil of our modern century?",
  "What did the universe's own phase transitions leave behind?": "What did the universe's own phase transitions leave behind?",
  "What did the whales agree to hold for us when the seas were young?": "What did the whales agree to hold for us when the seas were young?",
  "What did this month teach me about the law of my own attention?": "What did this month teach me about the law of my own attention?",
  "What do beings of the fifth density know about time that we are learning?": "What do beings of the fifth density know about time that we are learning?",
  "What do former warriors of the stars do when they finally lay it down?": "What do former warriors of the stars do when they finally lay it down?",
  "What do galleries of light keep in place of paintings and pedestals?": "What do galleries of light keep in place of paintings and pedestals?",
  "What do gears know about cooperation that teams could study?": "What do gears know about cooperation that teams could study?",
  "What do I do when an opening shows me a life I cannot yet live?": "What do I do when an opening shows me a life I cannot yet live?",
  "What do I do with the residue of someone else's hard day?": "What do I do with the residue of someone else's hard day?",
  "What do I owe the people my boundaries were never about?": "What do I owe the people my boundaries were never about?",
  "What do I say aloud to make my home recognizable to benevolent eyes?": "What do I say aloud to make my home recognizable to benevolent eyes?",
  "What do Inner Earth archivists write about the dreams of surface children?": "What do Inner Earth archivists write about the dreams of surface children?",
  "What do meaningful coincidences ask of me when they line up?": "What do meaningful coincidences ask of me when they line up?",
  "What do mitochondria remember about their free-living ancient past?": "What do mitochondria remember about their free-living ancient past?",
  "What do pilots of the light fleets log about the moods of Earth?": "What do pilots of the light fleets log about the moods of Earth?",
  "What do the Andromedans see in our traffic jams that we cannot?": "What do the Andromedans see in our traffic jams that we cannot?",
  "What do the Andromedans teach about freedom inside vast federations?": "What do the Andromedans teach about freedom inside vast federations?",
  "The song a state of being radiates. Similar songs attract; dissonant ones fall away — the law beneath every meeting.": "Kënga që gjendja e ekzistencës e rrezaton. Këngë të ngjashme tërhiqen; ato që janë disharmonike bien larg — ligji nën çdo takim.",
  "The souls of your origin civilization who know you by your first frequency — the family before the family of Earth.": "Shpirtrat e qytetërisë së origjinës tuaj që e njihin sipas frekuencës së tuaj të parë — familja para familjes së Tokës.",
  "The state where heart rhythm and mind settle into one smooth wave — the doorway through which intuition walks.": "Gjendja në ritmin e zemrës dhe mendja bien në një valë të lëmuar — dera nëpër të ecin intuita.",
  "The story of a protein is written in the scroll of DNA — and one wrong letter keeps retelling it as disease.": "Historia e një proteini shkruhet në rullin e ADN-së — dhe një shkronjë e gabuar e tregon përsëri si sëmundje.",
  "The structure of light holding memory in perfect order — cells, stones and cities of the new frequency all share it.": "Struktura e dritës që mban kujtesën në rend të përsosur — qelizat, gurët dhe qytetet e frekuencës së re e ndajnë të gjitha.",
  "the ternary complex locks": "kompleksi ternar kyçet",
  "the two-handed tether": "lidhja dy-dore",
  "The vast civilizational spaces within the planet, holding continuity with surface humanity's oldest memories.": "Hapësirat e mëdha qytetërore brenda planetit, që mbajnë vazhdimësinë me kujtimet më të vjetra të njerëzimit sipërfaqësor.",
  "The vaster you that never left the whole — it speaks as quiet knowing, synchronicity, and the calm voice beneath fear.": "Ti më i madh që nuk e la kurrë tërësinë — ai flet si një dije e qetë, sinkronicitet dhe zë i qetë nën frikë.",
  "timeline": "vija kohore",
